  "traits": [
    {
      "name": "Gang Warfare",
      "description": "Brigands draw courage from numbers. While the brigands in a fight (counting every kind of brigand) outnumber their humanoid enemies, each brigand gains a bonus die on its attack rolls. While the brigands are outnumbered by their humanoid enemies, each brigand suffers a penalty die on its attack rolls instead. Non-humanoid enemies such as beasts and summons are not counted, and even numbers have no effect."
